  516+0000
  517+0000              	;8= upload: vyprsel limit cekani na SEND OK po odeslani bloku
  518+0000              	;44= upload: pretekla prijmova fronta odpovedi modulu
  519+0000              	;45= upload: modul vratil SEND FAIL
  520+0000              	;46= upload: modul vratil ERROR
  521+0000              	;47= upload: modul ohlasil CLOSED
  522+0000              	;9= error in entering passive mode (enter_passive_mode)			...OK
  523+0000              	;14=file not exist							...OK
  524+0000              	;15=disk error								...OK
  525+0000              	;25= module not connected to AP, the user has to set his module externally.OK
  526+0000
  527+0000              ;ftp	;4= ftp answer, requested ftp code not found				...OK
  528+0000              	;old,not valid;4= check_module_answer routine did not found the answer from DE	...OK
  529+0000              	;5= uploaded data not sent correctly (ftp_upl_send)			...OK
  530+0000              	;6= cipsend_lod routine error. Module not ready to send data for upload	...OK
  531+0000              	;10= error in connecting to ftp server (ftp_login)(probably wrong URL)	...OK
  532+0000              	;11= error in receiving ftp answer to AT+CIPSEND "<" (receive_ftp_answer)..OK
  533+0000              	;12= "+IPD," string not found in the incoming bytes (look_for_ipd)	...OK
  534+0000              	;13= FTP server did not confirm answer 225 on download attempt (ftp_download_file, or retrieve directory...OK
  535+0000              	;16= ABOR command not successful					...OK
  536+0000              	;17= upload: connection not accepted (code 150 not received)		...OK
  537+0000              	;18= upload: transfer not ok (code 226 not accepted)			...OK
  538+0000              	;19= initial check. Connected to server, not good answer to NOOP cmnd	...OK
  539+0000              	;20= ABOR command initiated by the user					...OK
  540+0000              	;21= download: files does not exist					...OK
  541+0000              	;22= file does not exist on ftp server					...OK
  542+0000              	;23= download: block of data receive error				...OK
  543+0000              	;24= server did not respond with "226 Transfer OK"			...OK
  544+0000              	;26= no data available in passive receive mode (routine 84)		...OK
  545+0000              	;27= command for create dir not accepted (create dir)
